      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BUGATTI RICO (1) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (18.51) at Richmond behind Pearl Of Maui in a Grade 4/5. Settled off speed and worked to the line nicely. Has a strong record out of this box with six wins and two minor placings from 13 starts. Must come into calculations. HOVERING (4) was a last start winner (22.75) at Richmond who is building a strong winning record. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. DESI'S DREAM (3) scored (22.66) last time out over 400m at this track 11 weeks ago. Has a good record here at this journey. Looks well placed here and has the ability. Go well. FANTASIA QUEEN (2) can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
